---
// Philosophy — "From Mike" section in his own voice.
// Pull-quote is editorial framing; the paragraph below is verbatim from Mike.
---

<section class="bg-offwhite py-[var(--space-section)] px-4">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

    <!-- Eyebrow -->
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal mb-6 text-center">
      From Mike
    </p>

    <!-- Pull-quote -->
    <blockquote
      class="font-serif text-navy leading-tight mb-10 text-center"
      style="font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);"
    >
      &ldquo;A learning designation doesn't define a kid. What they're actually
      good at does. My job — and yours — is to find it and build around it.&rdquo;
    </blockquote>

    <!-- Mike's bio in his voice -->
    <div class="bg-paper rounded-lg p-8 sm:p-10 border border-offwhite">
      <p class="text-charcoal leading-relaxed mb-5" style="font-size: var(--fs-body);">
        Having worked with over a thousand families with neurodivergent
        children, I've seen a lot of very amazing children and young adults
        blossom into very successful adults. I could not be prouder of their
        accomplishments — artists, musicians, actors, entrepreneurs, tradespeople
        have all graduated from my program and gone on to successful careers.
      </p>
      <p class="text-charcoal leading-relaxed" style="font-size: var(--fs-body);">
        Working with these amazing children and their families has filled me
        with gratitude and hope for all children with neurodivergence. I look
        forward to continuing to work with these fabulous families through
        N2V education.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted text-sm mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-offwhite">
        — Mike Johnson, founder of N2V
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
